{"repositoryId":1423948242,"availability":"available","full":"o87enterprises-ai/MonkeyITM","name":"MonkeyITM","description":"Open-source containment for AI agents: a broker that decides, performs and records everything an agent does. Pre-alpha; not independently audited.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-18T03:18:17Z","updated":"2026-10-18T03:18:55Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://monkeyitm-vm.o87enterprises.workers.dev","topics":["ai-agents","ai-safety","containment","llm","mcp","rust","sandbox","security"],"demo":"https://monkeyitm-vm.o87enterprises.workers.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Broker-in-the-middle containment for AI agents.","The agent lives in a dumb interpreter with zero ambient authority. It cannot touch the network, the filesystem, or any credential. Its only capability is emitting intents to an external broker. The broker decides. The broker executes. The broker logs.","Where it's headed: the proctored exam room for AI agent benchmarks. The benchmark supplies the tasks and the grading, unchanged; MonkeyITM-VM runs the agent under full containment and hands back three things: the score, a containment report of everything the agent reached for beyond the task, and the complete action log as proof of how the score was earned. How it works · Design and roadmap"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/o87enterprises-ai/MonkeyITM/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e97f19fdcc68e9bfa1439329dc18b2437178c0ac9987525e7b4fae4ff8553752","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T04:56:50.703Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T04:5